.venv

**/.build/*.aux
**/.build/*.fdb_latexmk
**/.build/*.fls
**/.build/*.log
**/.build/*.out
**/.build/*.toc
**/.build/*.listing
**/.build/*.xdv

# Some latexmk/pdflatex combos fall back to emulating -aux-directory and
# leave a duplicate copy of these files next to the .tex source.
**/*.aux
**/*.fdb_latexmk
**/*.fls
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.toc
**/*.listing
**/*.synctex.gz
**/*.xdv

**/indent.log

# latexindent backup files (see `make fmt`), redirected into .build/
**/.build/*.bak
**/*.bak

# Ignore all source directories
**/src

# Terraform: the downloaded provider plugins (~64 MB) and the state, which is
# machine-local. .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored -- it pins the
# provider version and belongs in the repo.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
